  "name": "Barbarian: Spirit of Bloodshed debuffs sub-35% enemies, boosts Physical taken, procs Born in Blood, and resists hostile Spirit strips (#13528, #13668)",
  "contract": [
    "Spirit of Bloodshed 712468 periodically triggers 712681 (10 yd radius) to increase nearby enemies' Physical",
    "damage taken while below 35% health by 10% and causes killing blows to grant Born in Blood 560521.",
    "1) On a full-health Barbarian, 712681 must stay off a full-health enemy and must apply once that enemy drops",
    "   below 35% health, raising white melee Physical damage taken by 10% from both the Barbarian and an ally.",
    "2) 712468's killing-blow proc chance is 100% and deterministically grants Born in Blood 560521 across repeated kills.",
    "3) A hostile Barbarian's enemy area Spirit aura (Spirit of Savagery 707775) applying to our Barbarian must not",
    "   strip our Barbarian's own Spirit of Bloodshed 712468."
  ],
